 "summary": "Gateway profile for the Solectria PVI 50-100 kW inverters: 77 objects (31 AI, 17 AO, 29 BI), 72 polled by default. Inputs give DC voltage, AC power, grid frequency and voltages, AC energy, grid and fan hours, contactor cycles, critical and informative alarm bits and status bits. Outputs hold the grid-protection settings, a real power limit and a remote power-disable command.",
